  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.1.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.1.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "... Anno qui ultimus censetur Chindasuindi regis Hispaniarum, cum idem sanctus Martinus Romanus pontifex sedere coepisset, contigisse fertur revela- tio divinitus facta librorum Moralium S. Gregorii papae.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.1.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.1.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Describemus eam totidem verbis quibus esse conscripta reperitur; quam si prae vetustate pannis obsitam invenies, ne horrescas;",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.1.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.1.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed, illis exutis, nudum sensum veritatis candore et simplicitate ni- lentem considera, ut pote cui merito scriptores omnes Hispaniarum res prosecuti absque contro- versia ulla subscribant. Sic enim se habet :",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Chindasvindus Gothorum rex in Toletanam urbem synodale decretum triginta episcoporum, cum omni clero, mirifice, anno regni sui quinto, indicit cele- brandum.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hic Taionem Caesaraugustanum episco- pum, ordinis litteraturae satis imbutum, et amicum scripturarum, Romam ad suam petitionem pro resi- duis libris Moralium navaliter porrigit destinatum.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Qui dum a papa Romense de die in diem differretur in longum, quasi in archivo Romanae Ecclesiae prae multitudine quaesitum facile nequaquam reperirent libellum,",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dominum pernoctans, et ejus misericor- diam ad vestigia beati Petri apostoli principis depo- scens, ei scrinium in quo legebatur ab angelo manet ostensum.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quo mox se papa, ut praevidit, reprehen- sum, cum nimia veneratione ei adjutoria tribuit ad conscribendum, et Hispanis eum transmisit ad rele- gendum;",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quia hoc solum ex beati Job libris exposi- tum retentabant, quod per beatum Leandrum Hi- spalensem episcopum fuerat advectum, et olim ho- norifice deportatum.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Requisitus vero et conjuratus est Taio episcopus a Martino primo papa Romano, quomodo ei tam veridice fuisset librorum illorum locus ostensus,",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "hoc illi post nimiam deprecationem cum nimia alacritate est fassus, quod quadam nocte, se ab ostiariis ecclesiae beati Petri apostoli expetiit esse excubium.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Atque ubi hoc reperit impetratum, noctis medio cum se nimiis lamentis, ante beati Petri apostoli loculum faceret cernuum,",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "luce coeli- tus emissa ita ab inenarrabili lumine tota ecclesia exstitit perlustrata, ut nec modicum quidem lucerent ecclesiae candelabra,",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "simulque cum ipso lumine, una cum vocibus psallentium, et lampadibus relam- ptantium [Forte, relampantium] introire sanctorum agmina.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Denique ubi horrore nimio exstitit territus, oratione ab eis completa, paulatim ex illa sancto- rum curia duo dealbati senes egressum in ea parte qua episcopus in oratione degebat, coeperunt dare praependulum.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "At ubi eum repererunt pene jam mortuum, dulciter salutatum reduxerunt ad pro- prium sensum.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cumque ab eis interrogaretur quam ob causam tam grande exstaret fatigium, vel quis ab occidente properans tam longum peteret navige- rium; hoc et hoc ab eo, quasi inscii relatum auscul- tant operae pretium.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tum illi multis eloquiis conso- lato, opportunum, ubi ipsi libri latebant, ostende- runt loculum.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Igitur sancti illi requisiti quae esset sanctorum illa caterva, eos tam claro cum lumine comitantium, responderunt dicentes Petrum esse Christi apostolum,",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "simulque et Paulum invicem se manu tenentes, cum omnibus successoribus ecclesiae in illo loco requiescentibus.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s18",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Porro ubi et ipsi requi- siti fuerunt qui domini essent qui cum eo tam mira- bile habebant colloquium, unus ex illis respondit se esse Gregorium, cujus et ipse desiderabat cernere librum;",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s19",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et ideo advenire, ut ejus adremuneraretur tam vastum fatigium, et auctum redderet longissi- mum desiderium.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s20",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tunc interrogatus, si tandem in illa sancta multitudine adesset sapiens Augustinus eo quod ita libros ejus,",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s21",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s21",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sicut et ipsius sancti Gre- gorii semper ab ipsis cunabulis amaret legere satis peravidus, hoc solummodo respondisse refertur :",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.2.s22",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.2.s22",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vir ille clarissimus et omnium exspectatione gratis- simus Augustinus, quem quaeris, altior a nobis eum continet locus.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod enim nonnisi qui in ea basilica sancti sepul- ti essent eidem dicantur apparuisse, de Augustino videtur esse responsum alio eum loco detentum;",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.3.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sic- que corrigendum quod habetur, altiori eum loco detentum : alioqui, quomodo verum dici potuit Au- gustinum eminentiori loco in coelo positum,",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.3.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.3.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "cum ipsi apostolorum principes et alii complures mar- tyres pontifices in eadem sepulti ecclesia ea tunc visione apparuerint? Sed pergit auctor :",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.4.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.4.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Gene ubi ad eorum pedes coepit proruere, unicus ab oculis ejus, ostiariis et ipsis territis, simul cum luce evanuit vir ille sanctissimus;",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.4.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.4.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "unde et ab eo die a cunctis in eadem apostolorum sede venerabilis Taio exstitit gloriosus, qui ante despicabatur ut ignavus.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 667,
    "date_range": [
      651,
      683
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap#PL80.AP.5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/taio-caesaraugustanus/pl80_88_ap",
    "canonical_ref": "PL80.AP.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hactenus scriptio, quam recensitam habes in ap- pendice ad synodum Toletanam VII.",
